{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-various-fragrances-sold-by-savers-health-and-beauty-2605-0070","content_id":"589427a0-e7c8-4eea-9627-e9854f4d3e02","description":"Product Recall for Various Fragrances sold by Savers Health and Beauty presenting a serious chemical risk.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"6c2981af-9c0a-4e42-801f-c7273ea5835b","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-05-20T14:05:03+01:00","id":"6c2981af-9c0a-4e42-801f-c7273ea5835b","title":"Link to product images and PDF","updated_at":"2026-05-20T14:05:03+01:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a0db17f40a9c699fd826e95/2605-0070-product-recall-various-fragrances-savers-health-and-beauty.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Various Fragrances sold by Savers Health and Beauty</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The products present a serious chemical risk as they contain butylphenyl methylpropional (BMHCA/lilial) and/or hydroxyisohexyl 3-cyclohexene carboxaldehyde.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The product has been recalled from end users by Savers Health and Beauty.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Cosmetics, personal care and grooming - Fragrances</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>Unknown</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Fifteen fragrances by various brands sold by Savers Health and Beauty stores. The fragrances have butylphenyl methylpropional (BMHCA/lilial) and/or hydroxyisohexyl 3-cyclohexene carboxaldehyde included on the ingredients label on the packaging of the product.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_6c2981af-9c0a-4e42-801f-c7273ea5835b\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a0db17f40a9c699fd826e95/2605-0070-product-recall-various-fragrances-savers-health-and-beauty.pdf\">Link to product images and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h3 id=\"affected-products\">Affected products</h3>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Product description</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Affected barcode</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Batch numbers</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Ben Sherman Gold 100ml Eau De Toilette</td>\n      <td>5060074667139</td>\n      <td>BS11M100B</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Beyonce Rise 30ml Eau De Toilette</td>\n      <td>3607347575825</td>\n      <td>N/A</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Calvin Klein Encounter 30ml Eau De Toilette</td>\n      <td>3607348541812</td>\n      <td>D6 0360154033, D6 0360154735, C5 0358243115, C5 035243245, C5 0358243122</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Ck One 50ml Eau De Toilette</td>\n      <td>88300607686</td>\n      <td>9282</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Coolwater Ladies Eau De Toilette 30ml</td>\n      <td>3414202011820</td>\n      <td>7228, 7276</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Davidoff Hot Water 110ml</td>\n      <td>3607344163773</td>\n      <td>K90603810491, C006045742830065</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Davidoff Hot Water 60ml</td>\n      <td>3414200908559</td>\n      <td>L60776931240</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Fcuk 3 Female 100ml Eau De Toilette Spray</td>\n      <td>85715673800</td>\n      <td>16286, 16274</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Fcuk Original Her Eau De Toilette 100ml</td>\n      <td>870283001021 / 085715671028</td>\n      <td>5233U ,5232U, JK23, JH13</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Jean Paul Gaultier Classique 50ml Eau De Toilette</td>\n      <td>8435415011310</td>\n      <td>90161</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Kenzo Flower 50ml Eau De Toilette</td>\n      <td>3352818517858</td>\n      <td>3N01</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Missguided Babe Power Edp 10ml Boxed</td>\n      <td>5055654037600</td>\n      <td>95E2L</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Paul Smith Men 100ml Eau De Toilette</td>\n      <td>3386469215535</td>\n      <td>08K46K205, 08J06J007, 08K45K205</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Rihanna Kiss 100ml Eau De Toilette</td>\n      <td>608940567975</td>\n      <td>18073cV3</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Thierry Mugler Secret 50ml Eau De Toilette</td>\n      <td>3439600038446</td>\n      <td>094419719308</td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The products present a serious chemical risk as they contain butylphenyl methylpropional (BMHCA/lilial) and/or hydroxyisohexyl 3-cyclohexene carboxaldehyde. Both chemicals are prohibited in cosmetic products. BMHCA may harm the reproductive system, may harm the health of the unborn child, and may cause skin sensitisation.</p>\n\n<p>The products do not meet the requirements of Regulation (EC) 1223/2009 (‘The Cosmetics Regulation’).</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>Affected products have been recalled by Savers Health and Beauty.</p>\n\n<p>Customers should return any of the above products purchased at a Savers store to the place of purchase, where they will be issued a full refund.</p>\n\n<p>Only products purchased in Savers Health and Beauty stores with the barcodes listed are affected by this recall. If you are unsure if you have one of the above products, please contact Savers Health and Beauty on <a href=\"mailto:help@savers.co.uk\">help@savers.co.uk</a> or access <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.savers.co.uk/prodrecall\">Product Recalls - Savers</a>.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2605-0070</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-05-18T08:50:14Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"headers":[{"id":"affected-products","level":3,"text":"Affected products"}],"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-recall","product_category":"cosmetics","product_measure_type":["recall-of-product-from-end-users"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-05-18","product_risk_level":"serious"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2026-05-18T09:50:14+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-various-fragrances-sold-by-savers-health-and-beauty-2605-0070","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-various-fragrances-sold-by-savers-health-and-beauty-2605-0070","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-various-fragrances-sold-by-savers-health-and-beauty-2605-0070","content_id":"589427a0-e7c8-4eea-9627-e9854f4d3e02","document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-05-18T08:50:14Z","schema_name":"specialist_document","title":"Product Recall: Various Fragrances sold by Savers Health and Beauty (2605-0070)","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-various-fragrances-sold-by-savers-health-and-beauty-2605-0070","withdrawn":false}],"finder":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","content_id":"a22b3f1f-2c91-49a1-a469-ff21d465c543","details":{"facets":[{"allowed_values":[{"label":"Product safety alert","